@page "/Integrations/Glass/Callback/{correlation}"
@model Pegasus.Web.Pages.Integrations.Glass.CallbackModel
@* The provider's return has no page of its own: an accepted return waits in
   the Glass's window (Integrations/Glass/Opening) while its import runs, and
   every other outcome hands the Case record's Estimate section back to the
   Case window (Shared/_GlassReturn), or answers with a refusal or nothing
   found. A cross-site arrival without the Strict staff cookie is first
   bounced through this origin (Shared/_GlassBounce). *@
